Hello all,

I have recently configured a WireGuard tunnel between my Android phone and =
a CentOS Server. The userspace backend implementation functions as expected=
, I also get the key icon in the status bar on Android.

After granting root access to the WireGuard app and enabling the kernel mod=
ule backend, I discovered that some traffic was being routed outside the tu=
nnel. To confirm this, I created a dummy VPN profile and connected to it. A=
s expected, I lost internet access entirely. However, suprisingly, I still =
received notifications from Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM).
Additionally, the key icon is missing from the status bar when using the ke=
rnel module backend.

Stock Android with Google Play Services
Wireguard for Android : v1.0.20231018
Kernel module backend : v1.0.0

Best,
Rachid Alaoui
